                <head>[Enclosure No. 4.]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">General return showing the number and description of her
                        Majesty’s naval forces, royal marines, &amp;c., engaged in the recent
                        operations in the straits of Simonoseki; also those at or in transitu
                        between the several ports during the same period.</hi></p>
