                            guns.</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-top #border-bottom #border-right">Number of
                            men.</cell>
                        <cell cols="2" rendition="#border-top #border-bottom">Remarks showing
                            whether present during the operations at Simonoseki, or otherwise
                            employed as a portion of the squadron in Japan.</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
