                <p>Dated on board the Euryalus, at Yokohama, October 24, 1864.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">AUGUSTUS L. KUPER, <hi rendition="#italic">Vice-Admiral, and
                        Commander-in-Chief.</hi></p>
                <p>True copy:</p>
                <p rendition="#right">JOHN MACDONALD.</p>
