                <p rendition="#center">SUMMARY.</p>
                <p>Officers, 56; sergeants and rank and file, 1,295; horses, 45; guns, 10; mortars,
                    4; rocket tubes, 1.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ammunition.</hi>—200 rounds per gun; 500 rounds per
                    rifle.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">H. R. BROWNE, <hi rendition="#italic">Lieut. Col.</hi>, 2<hi
                        rendition="#italic">d and</hi> 20<hi rendition="#italic">th Regiments,
                        Comm’g Her Majesty’s Troops in Japan.</hi></p>
                <p>True copy:</p>
                <closer>
